216 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 19 0 R
/E (The narrative of our presentation follows the scientist Tempus in the year 3026, in a world where people no longer smile and society is devoid of joy. To reclaim the smiles the world has lost, the scientist, along with his assistant, ALL-IN, travels to the past in search of them. Throughout the presentation, he observes and shares the true reasons behind the smiles of the past, highlighting their importance for human connection and well-being. This entire performance is the result of a completely authentic and original creation developed by us, without inspiration from or reference to existing works.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [196]
>>
endobj
217 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 19 0 R
/E (AI Recognition uses a custom YOLO model trained with around 4,000 labeled images to identify smiling and non-smiling expressions in real time. Running on a Lenovo 2-in-1 laptop with Python and OpenCV, the system analyzes the webcam feed, displays the detected expression and confidence level, and turns smile recognition into an interactive element of the presentation.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [197]
>>
endobj
